course: dictionary
lesson: 12519
title: Descriptors: words that describe
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: A descriptor is a word or phrase that describes something or tells you what kind of thing it is. «The tall, spooky tree stood alone.» Tall and spooky are descriptors: they tell you what the tree is like.
explain: In English lessons, descriptors are usually describing words, such as adjectives. «Tall» and «spooky» are adjectives. A descriptor can also be a phrase, like «as cold as ice», which tells you what something is like.
explain: At school and in tests, the word can mean something different. A level descriptor is a sentence that explains what work looks like at each level or grade. Teachers read them to decide which level a piece of writing has reached.
explain: On a computer, a descriptor is a label that describes a file or item. In everyday talk, people usually say «word» or «description» instead of descriptor, so use it when the context is formal or about school.
fact: A descriptor is a word or phrase that describes something or tells you what kind of thing it is.
fact: «Spooky» is a descriptor in «the spooky house», because it tells you what kind of house it is.
fact: In English lessons, descriptors are often adjectives, such as «tall», «bright» and «gentle».
fact: In school, a level descriptor is a sentence that explains what work at a level looks like.
fact: In computing, a descriptor is a label or piece of data that describes a file or item.
exercise: Find the descriptor in «The little fox had a bushy tail.» Which word describes the tail? | fox | had | tail | *bushy
exercise: What is a descriptor? | A rule for spelling | *A word or phrase that describes something | A type of fish | A loud noise made by a drum
exercise: «The sky was grey and heavy.» Which word describes the sky? | *grey | sky | was | the
test: «The dragon was fierce.» Which word is the descriptor? | the | was | dragon | *fierce
test: In school, what does a level descriptor do? | It counts your spelling mistakes | It tells you the date of the test | It is the name of your teacher | *It explains what work at a level looks like
exam: Which word is a descriptor in «The lazy dog slept»? | dog | *lazy | slept | the
